#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:30
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " is "
msgstr "은(는)"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:30
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\tV E R Y P R E T T Y"
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t아 주 예 뻐 요"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:32
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "Nice! "
msgstr "좋아! "

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:32
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " Doesn't feel cursed at all by this delightful Weegee."
msgstr "은(는) 이 즐거운 위지 보드에 전혀 저주받은 기분이 안 든다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:34
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid ""
"Somewhere in the distance, a goblin laughs, but in a nice way. As if to say "
"'hey.... what's up. have a nice day.'"
msgstr "저 멀리서 고블린이 웃는다. 하지만 기분 좋게. 마치 '헤이.... 안녕. 좋은 하루 보내.' 하는 것처럼."

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:35
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "nice"
msgstr "기분 좋은"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:39
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " spells out the location of a hidden stash of loot in the house!"
msgstr "이(가) 집 안에 숨겨진 물자 위치를 짚어 준다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:46
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "When asked who will betray the group, the "
msgstr "누가 일행을 배신할지 묻자, "

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:46
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " spells out "
msgstr "이(가) 짚는 것은 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:48
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "'s name!"
msgstr "의 이름!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:52
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "Y O U R B U T T"
msgstr "네 엉 덩 이"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:53
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid ""
"What could this mean? The group becomes uneasy, and doubt festers. Could "
"this be the "
msgstr "무슨 뜻일까? 일행은 불안해지고 의심이 곪아 간다. 이것이 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:53
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "Curse of Weegee?"
msgstr "위지의 저주일까?"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:59
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " points to the word "
msgstr "이(가) 단어를 짚는다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:59
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "NO"
msgstr "아니"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:59
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " with amazing speed. Then it points to "
msgstr ". 엄청난 속도로. 그리고 다시 짚는다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:59
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " again, while somehow catching on fire."
msgstr ". 어째선지 불이 붙으면서."

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:60
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "Whatever! These things are always wrong, anyway! "
msgstr "뭐 어때! 이런 건 원래 다 틀려! "

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:60
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " throws the flaming "
msgstr "은(는) 불붙은 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:60
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " across the room. This makes "
msgstr "을(를) 방 저편으로 던진다. 그 바람에 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:60
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " also catch on fire."
msgstr "에게도 불이 붙는다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:62
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " loves being fireproof!"
msgstr "은(는) 방화 체질이라 너무 좋다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:68
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "It was good exercise, at least."
msgstr "그래도 좋은 운동은 됐다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:70
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "Don't mess with the "
msgstr "함부로 건드리지 마라: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:76
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "Weegee Board"
msgstr "위지 보드"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:77
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " is poking through an abandoned house and finds a "
msgstr "은(는) 버려진 집을 뒤지다가 발견한다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:77
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " on the kitchen table. It's a common game used to communicate with "
msgstr ". 부엌 식탁 위에 있다. 이걸로 소통한다는 흔한 놀이다. 대상은 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:77
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "GHOSTS"
msgstr "유령"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:78
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "Leave this NONSENSE alone"
msgstr "이런 헛소리는 건드리지 않는다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:79
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "These things are rumored to be "
msgstr "이런 건 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:79
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "INCREDIBLY CURSED WITH BAD LUCK"
msgstr "불운의 저주가 엄청나게 걸려 있다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:79
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid ", so beware! Still, it may be worth asking it a question..."
msgstr "는 소문이 있으니 조심하라! 그래도 질문 하나쯤은 해 볼 만할지도..."

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:81
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "AM I PRETTY?"
msgstr "나 예뻐?"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:83
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "WHO WILL BETRAY THE TEAM?"
msgstr "누가 일행을 배신할까?"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:85
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "WILL"
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:85
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "MAKE IT TO CANADA?"
msgstr "캐나다에 갈 수 있을까?"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:86
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "WHERE'S THE LOOT?"
msgstr "물자는 어디 있어?"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:95
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid ""
" ignores the supply box and all the food inside of it.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 보급 상자와 그 안의 식량을 전부 무시한다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:96
#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:177
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " find"
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:96
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid ""
" a couple cans of food while searching the rest of the house, but must "
"wonder what "
msgstr "집 나머지를 뒤져 통조림 몇 개를 찾지만, 놓친 게 뭘까 궁금해진다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:96
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " missed."
msgstr "이(가) 놓친 것."

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:103
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "The dog poop mysteriously disappears before "
msgstr "개똥이 어째선지 사라진다. 그 전에 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:103
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid ""
" nudges the box open!\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"이(가) 코로 상자를 밀어 연다!\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:104
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " looks really guilty."
msgstr "은(는) 엄청 찔리는 표정이다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:109
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid ""
" seems especially angry that it had to bat the dog poop out of the way to "
"open the box. "
msgstr "은(는) 상자를 열려고 개똥을 앞발로 쳐 내야 했던 게 유난히 화가 난다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:109
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " really feels like mauling something, moreso than usual."
msgstr "는 평소보다 더 뭔가를 물어뜯고 싶다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:114
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " kicks the supply box open. As an animal, "
msgstr "은(는) 보급 상자를 걷어차 연다. 동물이라서 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:114
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid ""
" really doesn't care either way for dog poo, so it wasn't much of an "
"obstacle."
msgstr "는 개똥에 별 관심이 없고, 그래서 장애물도 아니었다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:118
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid ""
" loves dogs, and is no stranger to picking up dog poop and putting it in a plastic bag.\r\n"
"\t\tIn fact, doing so reminds "
msgstr ""
"은(는) 개를 사랑해서, 개똥을 비닐봉지에 담는 데 익숙하다.\r\n"
"\t\t사실 그 행동이 일깨워 준다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:119
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " of civilization. Feeling that warmth in your hand, feeling alive!"
msgstr "에게 문명을. 손안의 그 온기, 살아 있다는 느낌!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:123
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid ""
" opens up the supply box. What was the big deal?\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 보급 상자를 연다. 뭐가 문제였지?\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:124
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " never noticed the dog poo."
msgstr "는 개똥을 전혀 못 봤다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:128
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " is grossed out!"
msgstr "은(는) 역겨워한다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:131
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid ""
" tries to nudge the poo off the box with a piece of wood, but it goes "
"HORRIBLY wrong. "
msgstr "은(는) 나무 막대로 개똥을 상자에서 밀어내려 하지만, 끔찍하게 잘못된다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:131
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " gets grossed out pretty bad!"
msgstr "는 제대로 역겨운 꼴을 당한다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:134
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " attempts to keep up a positive attitude. One day, "
msgstr "는 긍정적인 태도를 유지하려 한다. 언젠가 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:134
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " will be able to look at this and laugh. But not today."
msgstr "은(는) 이걸 보고 웃을 수 있을 것이다. 하지만 오늘은 아니다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:136
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "This is, by far, the worst thing to happen to "
msgstr "이건 단연코 최악의 일이다. 좀비 종말을 통틀어 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:136
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " in the zombie apocalypse. "
msgstr "에게 일어난. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:136
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " will never, ever be the same."
msgstr "는 결코, 절대 예전으로 돌아가지 못할 것이다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:137
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " PERMANENT MORALE PENALTY!"
msgstr " 영구 사기 감소!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:144
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "YOU WIN"
msgstr "승리"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:145
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid ""
"Every child knows that the only surefire way to move a piece of dog poo is to use a stick from a tree branch. It's nature's perfect poop remover.\r\n"
"\tYou channeled your sense of whimsy and child-like wonder to triumph over this dangerous situation."
msgstr ""
"모든 아이는 알고 있다. 개똥을 확실하게 치우는 유일한 방법은 나뭇가지를 쓰는 것이라는 걸. 자연이 준 완벽한 똥 치우개다.\r\n"
"\t너는 동심과 천진한 경이로움을 발휘해 이 위험한 상황을 이겨 냈다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:147
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "Congratulations!"
msgstr "축하합니다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:148
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "YOU'VE FOUND THE TRUE ENDING TO DEATH ROAD TO CANADA!"
msgstr "데스 로드 투 캐나다의 진엔딩을 찾았습니다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:149
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "I did it!"
msgstr "해냈다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:156
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "Who should open the crate?"
msgstr "누가 상자를 열까?"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:156
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\tWARNING: THIS IS REALLY GROSS\r\n"
"\t\tTHERE IS A DOG POO ON THE CRATE"
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t경고: 정말 역겨움\r\n"
"\t\t상자 위에 개똥이 있음"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:158
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\tTHIS COULD BE A BIG DEAL"
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t이건 큰일일 수도 있다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:165
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid ""
" improvises a little catapult with a big twig and an elastic band. They fire"
" stones at the handle to knock the poo off!"
msgstr "은(는) 큰 나뭇가지와 고무줄로 작은 투석기를 즉석에서 만든다. 손잡이에 돌을 쏴서 똥을 떨어뜨린다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:166
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "The plan works! The dog poo flies off the handle. "
msgstr "계획이 통한다! 개똥이 손잡이에서 날아간다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:166
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " opens the box, but is still grossed out by the stink."
msgstr "은(는) 상자를 열지만 냄새 때문에 여전히 역겹다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:169
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "The catapult snaps before "
msgstr "투석기가 부러진다. 그 전에 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:169
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " gets to use it as weapon. Drat!"
msgstr "이(가) 무기로 써 보려 했는데. 쳇!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:176
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "TRUE DESPAIR"
msgstr "진정한 절망"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:177
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "As "
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:177
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " searches an abandoned house, a miracle happens. "
msgstr "이(가) 버려진 집을 뒤지는데, 기적이 일어난다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:177
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " a government ration box, unopened."
msgstr "정부 배급 상자를 발견한다. 뜯지도 않았다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:178
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "To "
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:178
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " HORROR"
msgstr " 경악스럽게도"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:178
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid ", it turns out there is a "
msgstr ", 위에 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:178
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "dog poop"
msgstr "개똥"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:178
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " sitting "
msgstr "이 있다. 위치는 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:178
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "RIGHT ON THE HANDLE"
msgstr "손잡이 바로 위"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:178
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " of the supply box."
msgstr ". 보급 상자의."

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:178
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " There is no way to open it without touching the poo."
msgstr " 똥을 만지지 않고는 열 방법이 없다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:180
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "This could be the biggest challenge, yet!"
msgstr "이건 지금까지 중 최대의 난관일지도 모른다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:182
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "No Way, Gross, Ignore It"
msgstr "싫어, 더러워, 무시해"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:184
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " opens it"
msgstr "이(가) 연다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:186
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "Have someone open it"
msgstr "누군가에게 열게 한다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:190
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " makes a little catapult"
msgstr "이(가) 작은 투석기를 만든다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:194
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "Use tree branch to open it"
msgstr "나뭇가지로 연다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:201
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " can't sneeze on command. "
msgstr "은(는) 마음대로 재채기를 할 수 없다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:201
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " loses the sneeze! It's very annoying!"
msgstr "는 재채기를 놓친다! 엄청 짜증 난다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:204
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "This is the "
msgstr "이건 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:204
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "worst thing to happen to ANYONE"
msgstr "누구에게나 일어날 수 있는 최악의 일"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:204
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " in the zombocaylpse!"
msgstr "이다. 좀비 종말에서!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:211
#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:439
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " screams "
msgstr "은(는) 외친다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:211
#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:439
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "BERSERKEERRR!"
msgstr "버서커어어어!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:211
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " and then punches "
msgstr ". 그리고 주먹으로 친다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:211
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid ""
"self in the nose, as hard as possible. No self preservation instinct at all."
msgstr "자신의 코를, 있는 힘껏. 자기 보존 본능 따윈 없다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:214
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " smashes "
msgstr "은(는) 박는다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:214
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " own nose on a wall."
msgstr " 코를 벽에."

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:216
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "It's an old trick! The blinding pain makes "
msgstr "옛날 수법이다! 눈앞이 하얘지는 고통 덕분에 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:216
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " forget about the lost sneeze."
msgstr "은(는) 놓친 재채기를 잊는다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:222
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " really stuffs "
msgstr "은(는) 들이민다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:222
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " nose on "
msgstr " 코를 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:222
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid ""
" and snorts.\r\n"
"\tThis coaxes out a good sneeze!"
msgstr ""
"에게. 그리고 킁킁댄다.\r\n"
"\t그 덕분에 시원한 재채기가 나온다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:227
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " opens up a bag of super spicy chips. "
msgstr "은(는) 초매운 과자 봉지를 뜯는다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:227
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " takes a big sniff."
msgstr "는 크게 한 번 냄새를 맡는다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:228
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid ""
" accidentally sneezes into the bag! \r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 실수로 봉지 안에 재채기를 한다! \r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:229
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " may as well eat the entire bag of chips now."
msgstr "는 이제 그 과자를 다 먹는 수밖에 없다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:235
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "THE LOST SNEEZE"
msgstr "잃어버린 재채기"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:236
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " really feels that "
msgstr "은(는) 느낀다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:236
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid ""
" has to sneeze. This feeling drags on, but there's no sneeze.\r\n"
"\tThis may turn into one of those times a sneeze is lost! Combined with the pressures of the zombocalypse, this could break "
msgstr ""
"가 재채기를 해야겠다고. 그 느낌은 계속되는데, 재채기가 안 나온다.\r\n"
"\t재채기를 놓쳐 버리는 그런 때가 될지도 모른다! 좀비 종말의 압박과 합쳐지면, 이건 무너뜨릴 수 있다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:237
#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:498
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "'s morale!"
msgstr "의 사기를!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:238
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "Try to sneeze"
msgstr "재채기를 시도한다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:239
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "Smash self on nose"
msgstr "코를 박는다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:240
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "Snort animal dander"
msgstr "동물 비듬을 들이마신다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:241
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "Snort spicy food - Costs 2 food"
msgstr "매운 음식 냄새를 맡는다 - 식량 2"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:247
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "This game is way too difficult! "
msgstr "이 게임 너무 어려워! "

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:247
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "AAAAAAAAAARGH!"
msgstr "으아아아아아아아악!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:248
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " throws the GameBronus hard, destroying it."
msgstr "은(는) 게임브로너스를 세게 던져 박살 낸다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:253
#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:292
#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:305
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "Drobnus Squadron"
msgstr "드롭너스 편대"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:253
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid ""
" is a game about Drobnus blasting aliens with a machinegun. Most deaths "
"happen due to bad jumping controls mixed with instant-kill pits."
msgstr "은(는) 드롭너스가 기관총으로 외계인을 쏘는 게임이다. 대부분의 죽음은 구린 점프 조작과 즉사 구덩이의 조합 때문이다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:259
#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:274
#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:303
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "Dr. Drobnus Deluxe"
msgstr "닥터 드롭너스 디럭스"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:259
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid ""
" is an overly detailed surgery sim, rendered in 8 bit graphics. Most players"
" lose by failing proper sterile surgical gloves procedure."
msgstr "은(는) 지나치게 디테일한 8비트 수술 시뮬레이터다. 대부분의 플레이어는 멸균 수술 장갑 절차를 제대로 못 지켜서 진다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:265
#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:283
#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:304
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "Drobnus Kart"
msgstr "드롭너스 카트"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:265
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid ""
" is a racing game starring the popular character Drobnus and all his pals. "
"Even if you're in first place, you can get hit by a Homing Toilet and end up"
" in last place."
msgstr "은(는) 인기 캐릭터 드롭너스와 친구들이 나오는 레이싱 게임이다. 1등이어도 유도 변기에 맞으면 꼴등이 될 수 있다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:274
#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:283
#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:292
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "Who should get to play "
msgstr "누가 플레이할까? "

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:275
#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:284
#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:293
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "WARNING: It's going to be rough on morale!"
msgstr "경고: 사기에 꽤 타격이 있을 것이다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:298
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "GameBronus Entertainment System"
msgstr "게임브로너스 엔터테인먼트 시스템"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:299
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " finds an old "
msgstr "은(는) 오래된 이걸 찾는다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:299
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "GameBronus [TM]"
msgstr "게임브로너스 [TM]"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:299
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\tIt's a handheld videogame system that survived this long because it's built like a brick.\r\n"
"\tThere were a few games with it, all known for their "
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t벽돌처럼 튼튼하게 만들어져서 지금까지 살아남은 휴대용 게임기다.\r\n"
"\t게임이 몇 개 있는데, 모두 이걸로 유명하다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:301
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "extremely frustrating difficulty:"
msgstr "극도로 짜증 나는 난이도"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:302
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "Leave GameBronus behind"
msgstr "게임브로너스를 두고 간다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:312
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "Garbage gets all over "
msgstr "쓰레기를 뒤집어쓴다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:312
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "! It was worth it! It was all for the beans!"
msgstr "! 그럴 가치가 있었다! 다 콩을 위해서였다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:318
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid ""
" eats some of the garbage pile! This jostles the can of beans at the top "
"loose, without the whole pile coming down on "
msgstr "은(는) 쓰레기 더미를 좀 먹는다! 덕분에 꼭대기의 콩 통조림이 흔들려 떨어지고, 더미 전체가 무너져 내리지도 않는다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:318
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid ""
".\r\n"
"\tWhat a delicious solution!"
msgstr ""
"의 위로.\r\n"
"\t아주 맛있는 해결책이다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:324
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " smashes the garbage pile! It collapses right onto "
msgstr "은(는) 쓰레기 더미를 부순다! 그대로 무너져 내린다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:333
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid ""
" uses their parkour skills to ascend the mountain of garbage with ease! "
"Before it collapses, they swan dive into a dumpster. The trash bags cushion "
"the landing!"
msgstr "은(는) 파쿠르 실력으로 쓰레기 산을 가뿐히 오른다! 무너지기 전에 쓰레기통으로 다이빙한다. 쓰레기봉투가 착지를 받쳐 준다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:337
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " climbs the garbage pile! It collapses with "
msgstr "은(는) 쓰레기 더미를 오른다! 무너진다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:337
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " on it."
msgstr "를 태운 채로."

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:345
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "Who should fight the garbage pile?"
msgstr "누가 쓰레기 더미와 싸울까?"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:353
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "Who should climb the garbage pile?"
msgstr "누가 쓰레기 더미를 오를까?"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:361
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "Who should eat the garbage pile?"
msgstr "누가 쓰레기 더미를 먹을까?"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:366
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "The Battle of Garbage Mountain"
msgstr "쓰레기 산의 전투"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:367
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid ""
" spots an extra tall pile of garbage near some buildings. It's maybe over 12 feet tall. Littering got pretty bad near the collapse of civilization.\r\n"
"\tAn "
msgstr ""
"은(는) 건물들 근처에서 유난히 높은 쓰레기 더미를 발견한다. 4미터는 넘을 것 같다. 문명이 무너질 무렵 쓰레기 투기가 꽤 심했다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:368
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "Extra Large Can O' Baked Beans"
msgstr "특대 베이크드 빈스 통조림"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:368
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " is stuck near the top of the pile. It shines like a beacon of hope."
msgstr "이(가) 더미 꼭대기 근처에 끼어 있다. 희망의 등대처럼 빛난다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:369
#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:560
#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:582
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "Leave it alone"
msgstr "그냥 둔다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:370
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "Smash garbage pile"
msgstr "쓰레기 더미를 부순다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:371
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "Climb garbage pile"
msgstr "쓰레기 더미를 오른다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:372
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "Eat garbage pile"
msgstr "쓰레기 더미를 먹는다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:379
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "The TV shorts out after the movie, and is left behind."
msgstr "영화가 끝나고 TV가 나가 버려서 두고 간다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:385
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " learns sumo, despite being a dog."
msgstr "은(는) 개인데도 스모를 배운다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:390
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " learns superior sumo techniques!"
msgstr "은(는) 더 뛰어난 스모 기술을 배운다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:396
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid ""
"Sumo Wrestling was in the top 5 sports in America before the zombocalypse. "
"This lead to a lot of sumo movies, sumo TV dramas, sumo cartoons, so on and "
"so forth."
msgstr "스모는 좀비 종말 전 미국 5대 스포츠 중 하나였다. 그래서 스모 영화, 스모 드라마, 스모 만화 같은 게 잔뜩 나왔다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:397
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " picks up some sumo moves by watching the film!"
msgstr "은(는) 영화를 보며 스모 기술 몇 가지를 익힌다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:402
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "The videotape is a movie adaptation of the arcade game "
msgstr "비디오테이프는 오락실 게임을 영화화한 것이다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:402
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "DEATHSPLOSIONAL!"
msgstr "데스플로저널!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:402
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " It's better than no movie at all."
msgstr " 영화가 아예 없는 것보단 낫다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:408
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid ""
" follows the the fitness instructor on the videotape. Everyone's wearing "
"neon sweatbands."
msgstr "은(는) 비디오테이프 속 피트니스 강사를 따라 한다. 다들 형광 땀받이 밴드를 차고 있다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:414
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "The comedy film turns out to be terrible by most standards, but "
msgstr "코미디 영화는 대부분의 기준으로 보면 끔찍하지만, "

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:414
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " is completely absorbed by it. It's very rare to see a movie anymore."
msgstr "은(는) 완전히 빠져든다. 이제 영화를 볼 일은 정말 드물다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:415
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid ""
"The TV shorts out during the middle of the second viewing, and never comes "
"back on."
msgstr "두 번째로 보던 중에 TV가 나가 버리고, 다시는 안 켜진다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:419
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "Video Cassette Player"
msgstr "비디오 플레이어"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:420
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid ""
" finds someone's abandoned hideout in a boarded up house.\r\n"
"\tThere's not much left in here, except a small battery powered TV hooked up to an old VHS player.\r\n"
"\tThere's only one movie in the videotape player:"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 판자로 막힌 집에서 누군가의 버려진 은신처를 발견한다.\r\n"
"\t남은 건 별로 없고, 낡은 VHS 플레이어에 연결된 작은 배터리 TV가 있다.\r\n"
"\t비디오 플레이어엔 영화가 하나뿐이다:"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:423
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "Action Movie"
msgstr "액션 영화"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:424
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "Fitness Tape"
msgstr "운동 비디오"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:425
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "Comedy Film"
msgstr "코미디 영화"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:426
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "Sumo Movie"
msgstr "스모 영화"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:432
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid ""
" runs out of that house!\r\n"
"\tThe spider continues slowly walking on the walls in a creepy, disgusting manner."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 그 집을 뛰쳐나간다!\r\n"
"\t거미는 계속 소름 끼치고 역겹게 벽을 천천히 기어 다닌다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:439
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " and then "
msgstr ". 그리고 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:439
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "OBLITERATES"
msgstr "말살한다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:439
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " the spider. Only a wisp of smoke remains of it."
msgstr " 거미를. 연기 한 줄기만 남는다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:442
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " smooshes the spider. There's a particularly gross crunching noise."
msgstr "은(는) 거미를 짓뭉갠다. 유난히 역겨운 바삭 소리가 난다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:445
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " searches the house and finds some food!"
msgstr "은(는) 집을 뒤져 식량을 좀 찾는다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:452
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "Who should have to smoosh the spider?"
msgstr "누가 거미를 짓뭉갤까?"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:469
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid ""
" looks around to make sure no one is watching, then quickly eats the spider.\r\n"
"\tIt's crunchy."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 아무도 안 보는지 확인하고 재빨리 거미를 먹는다.\r\n"
"\t바삭하다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:473
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "I was hungry..."
msgstr "배고팠어..."

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:482
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "Who should eat the spider?"
msgstr "누가 거미를 먹을까?"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:488
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " demands that his pet devour the spider."
msgstr "은(는) 자기 펫에게 거미를 먹어 치우라고 명령한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:489
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "Spidey"
msgstr "스파이디"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:489
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " leaps at the inferior spider and eats it, whole, in a single gulp."
msgstr "이(가) 열등한 거미에게 달려들어 통째로 한입에 삼킨다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:490
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "CRUNCH CRUNCH CRUNCH CRUNCH"
msgstr "와그작 와그작 와그작 와그작"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:491
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " feels pride!"
msgstr "은(는) 뿌듯하다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:496
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "Giant Spider Attack"
msgstr "거대 거미의 습격"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:497
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " tries to rest in a house but is ambushed by a "
msgstr "은(는) 집에서 쉬려다 기습당한다. 상대는 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:497
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "giant spider!"
msgstr "거대 거미!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:498
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid ""
"Well maybe it's a normal spider but it's gross looking. The spider is "
"rapidly draining "
msgstr "뭐, 평범한 거미일 수도 있지만 생긴 게 역겹다. 거미가 빠르게 갉아먹고 있다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:499
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "Run in disgust"
msgstr "역겨워서 도망친다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:500
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "Smoosh spider"
msgstr "거미를 짓뭉갠다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:501
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "Eat Spider"
msgstr "거미를 먹는다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:504
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid ": Predator meet prey!"
msgstr ": 포식자와 먹잇감의 만남!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:515
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid ""
"It takes forever to feed in the dollar bills. The vending machine keeps "
"spitting them out."
msgstr "지폐를 넣는 데 한참 걸린다. 자판기가 자꾸 뱉어 낸다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:519
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "A fully loaded shotgun pops out of the vending machine!"
msgstr "자판기에서 장전된 산탄총이 튀어나온다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:523
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "A loaded cowboy rifle pops out of the vending machine!"
msgstr "자판기에서 장전된 카우보이 소총이 튀어나온다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:527
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "A loaded Dolt revolver pops out of the vending machine!"
msgstr "자판기에서 장전된 돌트 리볼버가 튀어나온다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:531
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid ""
"A bag of chips drops out! Not the usual vending machine size, it's the "
"enormous family size."
msgstr "과자 봉지가 떨어진다! 자판기용 크기가 아니라 초대형 패밀리 사이즈다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:534
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "A jerrycan of gasoline plops out of the vending machine!"
msgstr "자판기에서 휘발유 통이 툭 떨어진다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:537
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "A large box of medicated bandages pops out of the vending machine!"
msgstr "자판기에서 약 처리된 붕대 상자가 튀어나온다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:540
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid ""
"The vending machine's shape changes! It transforms into an electric car!\r\n"
"\t\t\t"
msgstr ""
"자판기의 모양이 바뀐다! 전기차로 변신한다!\r\n"
"\t\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:541
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " gets in."
msgstr "은(는) 올라탄다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:544
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid ""
"A stick drops out of the vending machine! I'm not sure what you were "
"expecting, it's a stick."
msgstr "자판기에서 막대기가 떨어진다! 뭘 기대했는지 모르겠지만, 막대기다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:548
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid ""
"A hat pops out of the vending machine!\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"자판기에서 모자가 튀어나온다!\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:549
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " puts it on."
msgstr "은(는) 그걸 쓴다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:558
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid ""
" is going to have to feed the torn and wrinkled bills into the vending "
"machine. This will be annoying."
msgstr "은(는) 찢어지고 구겨진 지폐를 자판기에 넣어야 한다. 짜증 날 것이다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:559
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid ": Feed bills in"
msgstr ": 지폐를 넣는다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:562
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "Who should feed the mostly-rotted dollar bills into the machine?"
msgstr "누가 거의 썩은 지폐를 자판기에 넣을까?"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:563
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "WARNING: This will be a very annoying process"
msgstr "경고: 아주 짜증 나는 과정임"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:565
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "Leave it alone after all"
msgstr "결국 그냥 둔다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:579
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "Strange Vending Machine"
msgstr "이상한 자판기"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:580
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid ""
" runs into a very out of place vending machine. It looks like someone made it from chunks of scrap iron. Its lights are still on.\r\n"
"\tEverything in the machine costs $20, and "
msgstr ""
"은(는) 생뚱맞은 자판기를 만난다. 누가 고철 덩어리로 만든 것 같다. 불도 아직 켜져 있다.\r\n"
"\t전부 $20이고, "

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:581
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " has about that much in wrinkled and frayed bills."
msgstr "에게 딱 그 정도의 구겨지고 해진 지폐가 있다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:585
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "SHOTGUN FUN PACK"
msgstr "산탄총 즐거움 팩"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:588
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "ROOTEM TOOTEM RIFLE"
msgstr "빵야빵야 소총"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:590
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "REAL REVOLVER SET"
msgstr "진짜 리볼버 세트"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:595
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "BAG OF CHIPS"
msgstr "과자 한 봉지"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:598
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "GASOLINE CAN"
msgstr "휘발유 통"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:600
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "BOX O' BANDAGE"
msgstr "붕대 상자"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:605
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "A BRAND NEW CAR!"
msgstr "신차!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:608
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "A STICK"
msgstr "막대기"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:610
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "A NEW HAT"
msgstr "새 모자"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:8
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "The future toilet emits a whirring noise and stops working."
msgstr "미래형 변기가 윙윙 소리를 내더니 작동을 멈춘다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:11
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
"The toilet sprays an enormous amount of water from a hidden bidet. This "
"coats the room in water, but most of it hits "
msgstr "변기 숨은 비데에서 엄청난 양의 물이 뿜어져 나온다. 방이 온통 젖지만, 대부분은 정통으로 맞는다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:11
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " right in the eyes."
msgstr "의 눈에."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:13
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " delighted by this! "
msgstr " 이걸 보고 즐거워한다! "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:14
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "But wait! The bidet water was medicated and pleasantly scented! "
msgstr "그런데 잠깐! 비데 물이 약용에 향까지 좋다! "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:14
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "'s vision sharpens!"
msgstr "의 시력이 좋아진다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " is fully healed by the medicated bidet water!"
msgstr "은(는) 약용 비데 물로 완전히 회복된다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:20
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Song of the Toilet"
msgstr "변기의 노래"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:21
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
"The toilet plays beautiful music. The music has no words, yet conveys a "
"strong and haunting message of hope."
msgstr "변기가 아름다운 음악을 연주한다. 가사는 없지만, 강렬하고 잊히지 않는 희망의 메시지를 전한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:26
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
"The toilet's lid opens and closes rapidly, with big WHOOMP sounds as the lid"
" flings out gusts of air. The lid opens and closes about 30 times in a row, "
"then stops."
msgstr "변기 뚜껑이 빠르게 열렸다 닫혔다 하며 '훅' 소리와 함께 바람을 뿜는다. 30번쯤 반복하더니 멈춘다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:27
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " is confused by the purpose of this function."
msgstr "은(는) 이 기능의 목적을 이해하지 못한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:32
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "The toilet seat starts to hum and glow slightly."
msgstr "변기 시트가 웅웅거리며 살짝 빛나기 시작한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:33
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " sits down. The eletronic toilet seat gives "
msgstr "은(는) 앉는다. 전자 변기 시트가 해 준다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:33
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " a powerful gluteal"
msgstr "에게 강력한 둔부"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:33
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " massage, as the toilet repeatedly chants in different languages:"
msgstr " 마사지를. 그러면서 변기가 여러 언어로 반복해서 읊조린다:"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:34
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
"THE GLUTES ARE THE KEY TO FITNESS\r\n"
"\tTHE GLUTES ARE THE KEY TO STRENGTH\r\n"
"\tTHE GLUTES ARE THE KEY TO POWER\r\n"
"\tTHE GLUTES ARE THE CENTER OF LIFE"
msgstr ""
"둔근이 체력의 열쇠다\r\n"
"\t둔근이 근력의 열쇠다\r\n"
"\t둔근이 힘의 열쇠다\r\n"
"\t둔근이 생명의 중심이다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:39
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "*Vocabulary note: Gluteal means 'butt'"
msgstr "*어휘 노트: 둔부는 '엉덩이'라는 뜻"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:43
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Toilet of the Past's Future"
msgstr "과거의 미래 변기"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:44
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
" discovers something incredible while exploring a house: An actual working toilet. Everyone has been doing their business in the woods.\r\n"
"\tThe toilet has a futuristic control panel full of buttons. "
msgstr ""
"은(는) 집을 뒤지다 놀라운 걸 발견한다: 진짜로 작동하는 변기. 다들 숲에서 볼일을 봐 왔었다.\r\n"
"\t변기엔 버튼이 가득한 미래형 제어판이 있다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:45
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
" feels compelled to press one, and chooses the button labelled with a "
"picture of:"
msgstr "은(는) 하나 눌러 보고 싶어서, 이런 그림이 그려진 버튼을 고른다:"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:46
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Jets of Water?"
msgstr "물줄기?"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:47
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Musical Notes"
msgstr "음표"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:48
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Wings Flapping"
msgstr "날개 퍼덕임"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:49
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "A Butt?"
msgstr "엉덩이?"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:54
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "With the day wasted, "
msgstr "하루를 날려서, "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:54
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " has to set up camp."
msgstr "은(는) 야영을 해야 한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:55
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
"The shop is a trendy upscale grocery store. Most of the fancier items have "
"rotted to mush, but there's still some loot."
msgstr "가게는 고급 유기농 식료품점이다. 비싼 물건은 대부분 썩어 곤죽이 됐지만, 쓸 만한 건 아직 좀 있다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:61
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
" scampers towards the line and then passes it completely.\r\n"
"\t\tHours later, "
msgstr ""
"은(는) 줄 쪽으로 쪼르르 달려가더니 줄을 완전히 지나쳐 버린다.\r\n"
"\t\t몇 시간 뒤, "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:62
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " returns with a stick in "
msgstr "은(는) 막대기를 물고 돌아온다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:62
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " mouth."
msgstr " 입에."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:69
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " rushes into the shop, avoiding the line. "
msgstr "은(는) 줄을 피해 가게 안으로 뛰어든다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:69
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " emerges carrying a dead rodent, possibly a gerbil?"
msgstr "는 죽은 설치류를 물고 나온다. 아마 저빌?"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:74
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " lies down for a little break. As an animal, "
msgstr "은(는) 잠깐 쉬려고 드러눕는다. 동물이라서 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:74
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " either doesn't understand the concept of a line, or pretends not to."
msgstr "는 줄이라는 개념을 모르거나, 모르는 척한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:79
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " skips the line completely. "
msgstr "은(는) 줄을 완전히 건너뛴다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:79
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " didn't notice there was a line at all, or zombies."
msgstr "는 줄이 있는지도, 좀비가 있는지도 몰랐다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:85
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " just goes ahead and skips the line completely. "
msgstr "은(는) 그냥 대놓고 줄을 건너뛴다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:85
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " does NOT play by the rules!"
msgstr "는 규칙 따윈 안 지킨다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:88
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " lasts about a minute in the line before losing "
msgstr "은(는) 줄에 1분쯤 서 있다가 잃는다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:88
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " temper!"
msgstr " 성질을!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:90
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "WAITING IN LINE IS FOR NERDS!"
msgstr "줄 서는 건 찐따나 하는 거야!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:91
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
" starts speed-punching all the zombies in the line until they explode. "
"There's too many to punch so "
msgstr "는 줄 선 좀비들을 터질 때까지 연타하기 시작한다. 때릴 좀비가 너무 많아서 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:91
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " gets tired and stumbles away, sweating. What a workout!"
msgstr "는 지쳐서 땀범벅으로 비틀거리며 물러난다. 운동 한번 제대로 했다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:94
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " starts attacking the zombie in front of "
msgstr "는 공격하기 시작한다. 앞에 선 좀비를: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:94
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ". The other zombies eventually notice and start attacking. "
msgstr ". 다른 좀비들이 결국 눈치채고 공격하기 시작한다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:94
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " is forced to run!"
msgstr "은(는) 도망쳐야 한다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:99
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " patiently waits in the long line. It moves forward very slowly, but "
msgstr "은(는) 긴 줄에서 참을성 있게 기다린다. 아주 천천히 줄어들지만, "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:99
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " calmly waits it out."
msgstr "는 차분히 기다린다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:104
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " waits in line. It inches forward, to "
msgstr "은(는) 줄을 선다. 조금씩 줄어드는데, 그게 짜증 난다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:104
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "'s great irritation."
msgstr "에게 몹시."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:106
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " tries to think about this positively. "
msgstr "은(는) 긍정적으로 생각해 보려 한다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:106
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " manages to endure and get inside the store!"
msgstr "는 꾹 참고 가게 안까지 들어간다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:109
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "After hours of this, the zombies turn on "
msgstr "몇 시간 뒤, 좀비들이 등을 돌린다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:109
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " due to "
msgstr "에게. 이유는 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:109
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " constant whining. "
msgstr " 끝없는 징징거림. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:109
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " is forced to flee!"
msgstr "는 도망쳐야 한다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:115
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Choose who gets to wait in the zombie line:"
msgstr "누가 좀비 줄에 서서 기다릴지 고르세요:"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:120
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Still Having to Wait in Line"
msgstr "여전히 줄을 서야 한다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:121
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
" runs into a horde of zombies. They're completely docile, just waiting "
"outside of a shop in a big single-file line. Every zombie is staring "
"straight ahead."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 좀비 무리를 만난다. 완전히 얌전하고, 가게 밖에 한 줄로 길게 서서 기다리고 있다. 좀비들이 하나같이 정면만 바라본다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:122
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Ignore this weirdness"
msgstr "이 이상한 건 무시한다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:124
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "The shop's sign is faded out and can't be read."
msgstr "가게 간판이 바래서 읽을 수 없다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:125
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ": Wait in line"
msgstr ": 줄을 선다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:127
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
"You can send someone to join the line, to solve this mystery. It looks like "
"it could be a long wait."
msgstr "누군가를 줄에 세워서 수수께끼를 풀 수 있다. 오래 기다려야 할 것 같다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:130
#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:398
#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:508
#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:632
#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:923
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Pick someone else"
msgstr "다른 사람 고르기"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:139
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " is compelled to throw a rock at the hapless zombie."
msgstr "은(는) 저 불쌍한 좀비에게 돌을 던지고 싶은 충동을 참을 수 없다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:141
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " keeps accidentally throwing the rock in ways that make it return to "
msgstr "는 자꾸 실수로 돌을 던져서 되돌아오게 만든다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:141
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
". First it was straight up, then the next few times it hit the fence. This goes on for several hours.\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"에게. 처음엔 위로 똑바로, 그다음 몇 번은 울타리에 맞았다. 이게 몇 시간이나 이어진다.\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:142
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " eventually throws the rock over the fence, just barely. "
msgstr "은(는) 결국 간신히 울타리 너머로 돌을 던진다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:142
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " is nearly dead from exhaustion by then."
msgstr "는 그때쯤 지쳐서 거의 죽을 지경이다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:147
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " puts all "
msgstr "는 쏟아붓는다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:147
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
" might into a mighty downward throw. The rock misses the zombie, but "
"obliterates a small garden gnome."
msgstr " 온 힘을 내리꽂는 투구에. 돌은 좀비를 빗나가지만, 작은 정원 노움을 박살 낸다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:149
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " realizes that this is very offensive to "
msgstr "은(는) 이게 매우 모욕적임을 깨닫는다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:152
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
" performs a throw with perfect form. The rock sails gracefully through the "
"air. It misses the zombie by far, but what a nice throw!"
msgstr "는 완벽한 자세로 던진다. 돌이 우아하게 날아간다. 좀비는 한참 빗나갔지만, 멋진 투구다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:155
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " not only misses, but performs a really embarassing throw. "
msgstr "는 빗맞힐 뿐 아니라, 엄청 창피한 투구를 한다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:155
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " stumbles and nearly falls over the fence and off the cliff."
msgstr "는 비틀거리다 울타리 너머 절벽으로 떨어질 뻔한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:159
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "The Perfect Rock"
msgstr "완벽한 돌"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:160
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
" finds a perfect throwing rock on the ground. It is next to a low fence "
"guarding a big fall. At the bottom of this drop is a single zombie, standing"
" there, staring at nothing in particular."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 땅에서 던지기 딱 좋은 돌을 찾는다. 높은 낭떠러지를 막은 낮은 울타리 옆이다. 그 아래엔 좀비 한 마리가 허공을 멍하니 "
"바라보며 서 있다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:162
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " feels a burning desire to throw the rock at this zombie."
msgstr "은(는) 이 좀비에게 돌을 던지고 싶은 불타는 욕망을 느낀다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:163
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Leave zombie alone"
msgstr "좀비를 내버려 둔다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:164
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ": Throw rock!"
msgstr ": 돌을 던진다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:166
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "It's too good to pass up. Someone MUST throw that rock at this zombie:"
msgstr "이 기회를 놓칠 순 없다. 누군가 반드시 저 좀비에게 돌을 던져야 한다:"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:175
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " doesn't have a car right now, so it's not a very close race."
msgstr "은(는) 지금 차가 없어서, 별로 박빙의 승부가 아니다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:176
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "I WIN, NERDS!"
msgstr "내가 이겼다, 찐따들아!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:178
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "The race begins! Both drivers "
msgstr "경주가 시작된다! 두 운전자 모두 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:178
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "FLOOR IT!"
msgstr "밟아!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:180
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "'s slow car had no chance at all in this race."
msgstr "의 느린 차는 이 경주에서 전혀 승산이 없었다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:183
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "'s car is too slow, and is left far behind."
msgstr "의 차는 너무 느려서 한참 뒤처진다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:186
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Your car easily wins the race, leaving the other driver in the dust."
msgstr "네 차가 여유 있게 이기며 상대를 먼지 속에 남겨 둔다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:189
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Your car barely wins the race. The other driver gives a thumbs up."
msgstr "네 차가 간발의 차로 이긴다. 상대 운전자가 엄지를 치켜든다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:195
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "YOU CAN'T DO THAT! YOU CAN'T IGNORE A DRAG RACE CHALLENGE!"
msgstr "그럴 순 없지! 드래그 레이스 도전을 무시할 순 없어!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:197
#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:200
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "The driver bumps into "
msgstr "운전자가 들이받는다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:197
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
"'s car, but just bounces right off the armor.\r\n"
"\t\t\tThe driver's car careens off the road and crashes into a ditch."
msgstr ""
"의 차를. 하지만 장갑에 튕겨 나간다.\r\n"
"\t\t\t운전자의 차는 도로를 벗어나 도랑에 처박힌다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:198
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " is very amused by this."
msgstr "은(는) 이게 몹시 재밌다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:200
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "'s car, sending it into a spin."
msgstr "의 차를. 차가 빙글 돈다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:203
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "The car takes minor damage, and "
msgstr "차가 약간 손상되고, "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:203
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " gets hurt."
msgstr "은(는) 다친다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:205
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "The battered car couldn't take that stress. It stops running."
msgstr "너덜너덜한 차가 그 충격을 못 버티고 멈춰 버린다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:208
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "FINE, BE THAT WAY! I'LL BE BACK WHEN YOU HAVE A CAR!"
msgstr "좋아, 맘대로 해! 차 생기면 다시 온다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:209
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "The driver "
msgstr "운전자가 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:209
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "PEELS OUT!"
msgstr "급출발해 사라진다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:215
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Before the drag race can start, "
msgstr "드래그 레이스가 시작되기도 전에, "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:215
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " plows "
msgstr "은(는) 들이받는다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:215
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " car into the opponent's car."
msgstr " 차로 상대 차를."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:217
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
"Your armored car obliterates the fast but flimsy vehicle, the armor doesn't "
"even get scratched."
msgstr "네 장갑차가 빠르지만 허약한 차를 박살 낸다. 장갑엔 흠집 하나 안 났다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:221
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
"Both cars take damage, but the opponent's vehicle takes a lot more. You win "
"the race!"
msgstr "두 차 모두 손상됐지만, 상대 차가 훨씬 심하다. 경주에서 이겼다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:223
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
"Both cars are damaged enough to no longer drive. That makes the race a tie!"
msgstr "두 차 모두 더는 달릴 수 없을 만큼 망가졌다. 경주는 무승부다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:226
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "The annoying driver runs away, screaming "
msgstr "짜증 나는 운전자가 소리치며 도망간다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:226
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "CHEATER! "
msgstr "반칙이야! "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:226
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " siphons some gas from his wreckage."
msgstr "은(는) 그의 잔해에서 기름을 좀 빼낸다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:231
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " isn't clear on the rules of drag racing."
msgstr "은(는) 드래그 레이스 규칙을 잘 모른다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:232
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "THE ONLY RULE OF DRAG RACING... IS THAT THERE ARE NO RULES!"
msgstr "드래그 레이스의 유일한 규칙... 그건 규칙이 없다는 거다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:233
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
"The driver then goes on to ramble on about a long list of drag racing rules."
" "
msgstr "운전자는 그러고는 드래그 레이스 규칙을 길게 늘어놓기 시작한다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:235
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "During this, "
msgstr "그러는 동안, "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:235
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " goes ahead and siphons all the gas from the driver's car."
msgstr "은(는) 운전자의 차에서 기름을 전부 빼 버린다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:237
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "At around rule 60, "
msgstr "규칙 60번쯤에서, "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:237
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " slowly drives away while the driver keeps talking."
msgstr "은(는) 운전자가 계속 떠드는 사이 천천히 차를 몰고 떠난다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:242
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "FAAF 15: Gotta Go Fast"
msgstr "분노의 질주 15: 빨리 가야 해"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:243
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
"A fast and fancy car pulls up to you dramatically. The driver shouts from "
"his window:"
msgstr "빠르고 멋진 차가 극적으로 다가와 선다. 운전자가 창문 밖으로 외친다:"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:244
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
"ON THE DEATH ROAD, THE ONLY WAY TO SURVIVE IS TO BE FAST. AND ALSO FURIOUS."
msgstr "데스 로드에서 살아남는 유일한 길은 빨라지는 거다. 그리고 분노하는 거고."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:245
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "He challenges you to a drag race."
msgstr "그가 드래그 레이스를 신청한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:246
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Ignore lunatic"
msgstr "미친놈은 무시한다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:248
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Ram into his car"
msgstr "그의 차를 들이받는다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:250
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Accept challenge"
msgstr "도전을 받아들인다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:252
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ": Ask for rules"
msgstr ": 규칙을 묻는다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:259
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
" siphons the gas out of the generator. There wasn't much left, but every little bit helps.\r\n"
"\tThe radio station's power shuts down."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 발전기에서 기름을 빼낸다. 별로 안 남았지만, 조금이라도 도움이 된다.\r\n"
"\t라디오 방송국의 전원이 꺼진다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:270
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " says something along the lines of "
msgstr "은(는) 대충 이렇게 말한다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:270
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "BARK!"
msgstr "멍!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:270
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " or maybe "
msgstr " 아니면 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:270
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "BORK?"
msgstr "왕?"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:270
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\tHere's hoping that it confused a lot of people listening to their radios."
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t라디오 듣던 사람들이 많이 헷갈렸길 바란다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:276
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
" attacks the microphone!\r\n"
"\t\tThe microphone is destroyed!\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 마이크를 공격한다!\r\n"
"\t\t마이크가 박살 났다!\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:278
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " is very pleased about getting rid of this threat."
msgstr "은(는) 위협을 제거해서 아주 흡족하다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:282
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
" turns the microphone on by accident, then blurts out a lot of embarassing personal facts.\r\n"
"\t\tThis includes some useful information to bandits, such as location and current amount of supplies."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 실수로 마이크를 켜고 창피한 개인사를 잔뜩 털어놓는다.\r\n"
"\t\t여기엔 위치나 현재 물자량 같은, 약탈자에게 유용한 정보도 포함된다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:288
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " repeatedly shrieks "
msgstr "은(는) 반복해서 외친다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:288
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "COOL IT!"
msgstr "진정해!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:288
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
" into the microphone.\r\n"
"\t\tAfter eleven of these shrieks, the radio equipment shorts out and the generator lights on fire."
msgstr ""
" 마이크에 대고.\r\n"
"\t\t열한 번 외치자, 방송 장비가 합선되고 발전기에 불이 붙는다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:293
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
" broadcasts a long, nearly breathless rant about how the zombie apocalypse was created by the government.\r\n"
"\t\tThe project was codenamed "
msgstr ""
"은(는) 좀비 종말이 정부가 만든 거라는 거의 숨도 안 쉬는 긴 열변을 방송한다.\r\n"
"\t\t프로젝트 코드명은 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:294
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "PROJECT: DINGUS"
msgstr "프로젝트: 바보"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:294
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " and the intended goal was to serve as a smokescreen for making jorts"
msgstr "였고, 진짜 목적은 청반바지를 불법화하기 위한 연막이었다는 것이다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:295
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
" illegal.\r\n"
"\t\tFINALLY, the truth has been revealed!"
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t드디어 진실이 밝혀졌다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:297
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "* Note: Jorts mean 'jean shorts'."
msgstr "* 참고: 청반바지 = 'jorts'."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:301
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " broadcasts a helpful message:"
msgstr "은(는) 유익한 메시지를 방송한다:"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:303
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
"CIVILIZATION HAS ENDED!\r\n"
"\t\t\tLIE, CHEAT, STEAL GAS FROM TOILETS!\r\n"
"\t\t\tHOMEWORK SUCKS!!!"
msgstr ""
"문명은 끝났다!\r\n"
"\t\t\t거짓말하고, 속이고, 변기에서 기름을 훔쳐라!\r\n"
"\t\t\t숙제는 구려!!!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:306
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
"The last line of this tirade is yelled so loud that the microphone emits "
"feedback."
msgstr "이 열변의 마지막 줄을 너무 크게 외쳐서 마이크에서 하울링이 난다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:310
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
"EVERYONE BUT ME\r\n"
"\t\t\t... IS A NERD!"
msgstr ""
"나 빼고 다\r\n"
"\t\t\t... 찐따야!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:320
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " knows that "
msgstr "은(는) 알고 있다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:320
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
" message can save lives, and desperately rattles off as much practical "
"medical knowledge as "
msgstr " 메시지가 생명을 구할 수 있다는 걸. 그래서 필사적으로 실용적인 의학 지식을 쏟아낸다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:320
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
" can in a short time.\r\n"
"\t\t\tMaybe this can help someone."
msgstr ""
"가 짧은 시간에 할 수 있는 만큼.\r\n"
"\t\t\t누군가에게 도움이 되길."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:326
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " proudly spouts as much medical knowledge as "
msgstr "은(는) 자랑스럽게 의학 지식을 늘어놓는다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:326
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
" can in a short time.\r\n"
"\t\t\tIt's all really bad advice that makes anyone that hears it actually worse off."
msgstr ""
"가 짧은 시간에 할 수 있는 만큼.\r\n"
"\t\t\t전부 끔찍한 조언이라 들은 사람은 오히려 상태가 나빠진다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:335
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
" broadcasts a short impromptu talk show that is a crash course in car repair. It's informative and entertaining.\r\n"
"\t\t\tMaybe this can help someone."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 자동차 수리 속성 강좌 같은 즉석 토크쇼를 방송한다. 유익하고 재밌다.\r\n"
"\t\t\t누군가에게 도움이 되길."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:341
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
" rambles on about repairing sweet cars and 'crafting level 3 lighting-flame-chainsaws' until the power runs out.\r\n"
"\t\t\tAnyone that hears this actually gets worse at repairing things."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 멋진 차 수리와 '레벨 3 번개 불꽃 전기톱 제작'에 대해 전원이 나갈 때까지 떠든다.\r\n"
"\t\t\t이걸 들은 사람은 오히려 수리 실력이 떨어진다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:350
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
" creates an intense radio calisthenics show. Whoever is listening joins in with the exercises.\r\n"
"\t\t\tThe total combined sweat from this could fill up a bathtub."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 강렬한 라디오 체조 방송을 한다. 듣는 사람은 다 따라 한다.\r\n"
"\t\t\t이걸로 흘린 땀을 다 합치면 욕조를 채울 정도다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:359
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
" broadcasts some very effective tips and theories on zombie shooting.\r\n"
"\t\t\tDuring the show, "
msgstr ""
"은(는) 아주 효과적인 좀비 사격 팁과 이론을 방송한다.\r\n"
"\t\t\t방송 중에 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:360
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " even comes up with some new trick shots."
msgstr "는 새로운 묘기 사격까지 고안해 낸다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:368
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " reads a poem that "
msgstr "은(는) 시를 읽는다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:368
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " wrote about how much "
msgstr "가 쓴 시다. 내용은 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:368
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
" loves being strong.\r\n"
"\t\t\tThe Four Spirits of Swoleness hear this sweet poem, and they confer their blessing!"
msgstr ""
"가 힘센 게 얼마나 좋은지.\r\n"
"\t\t\t근육의 네 정령이 이 달콤한 시를 듣고 축복을 내린다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:376
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " can't come up with anything else, so "
msgstr "은(는) 아무것도 생각나지 않아서, "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:376
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
" sings a song.\r\n"
"\t\tIt's a great performance, sure to become a new post-zombocalpyic hit single!"
msgstr ""
"는 노래를 부른다.\r\n"
"\t\t끝내주는 공연이다. 좀비 종말 이후의 히트곡이 될 게 분명하다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:380
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
" can't think of anything to say, and stays silent even as the power runs "
"out."
msgstr "은(는) 할 말이 하나도 생각나지 않아서, 전원이 나갈 때까지 침묵한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:384
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Who gets to be the radio DJ?"
msgstr "누가 라디오 DJ를 할까?"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:389
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Death Road Radio"
msgstr "데스 로드 라디오"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:390
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
" finds a radio station. The broadcasting equipment is hooked up to a gas "
"generator with a small amount of fuel left. There's enough power to get out "
"one message to anyone that may hear it. "
msgstr ""
"은(는) 라디오 방송국을 찾는다. 방송 장비가 연료가 조금 남은 휘발유 발전기에 연결되어 있다. 들을지도 모르는 누군가에게 메시지 하나를"
" 보낼 만큼의 전력이 있다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:391
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Siphon generator"
msgstr "발전기 기름을 뺀다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:393
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ": Send a message"
msgstr ": 메시지를 보낸다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:395
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Who should send out the message?"
msgstr "누가 메시지를 보낼까?"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:407
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
"The message warns that the base has been abandoned, but they hid a stash of ammo to help other survivors.\r\n"
"\tThe stash turns out to be nearby!"
msgstr ""
"메시지는 기지가 버려졌지만 다른 생존자를 돕기 위해 탄약을 숨겨 뒀다고 알린다.\r\n"
"\t숨긴 곳이 근처다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:411
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "The team decodes an additional ultra-secret message:"
msgstr "일행은 추가 극비 메시지를 해독한다:"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:413
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "We also ditched "
msgstr "우리는 또 버리고 왔다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:413
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
" was a real nerd.\r\n"
"\t\t\tYou can recruit "
msgstr ""
". 진짜 찐따였다.\r\n"
"\t\t\t급하면 영입해도 된다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:414
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " if you are desperate."
msgstr "."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:422
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " tries to figure the code out by "
msgstr "은(는) 혼자 암호를 풀어 보려 한다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:422
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "self..."
msgstr "자신이..."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:425
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "The team puts their heads together to figure out the code..."
msgstr "일행이 머리를 맞대고 암호를 풀어 본다..."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:428
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "The message says something like "
msgstr "메시지는 대충 이런 내용이다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:428
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "DRINK MORE OVALTUMS"
msgstr "오발텀을 더 마셔라"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:429
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "It's just nonsense! What a waste of time!"
msgstr "그냥 헛소리다! 시간 낭비였다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:433
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
" attempts to drive to the signal by listening for the radio broadcast as it "
"gets weaker or stronger. This takes quite a bit of time."
msgstr "은(는) 라디오 방송이 약해지거나 강해지는 걸 들으며 신호를 따라가 본다. 시간이 꽤 걸린다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:435
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Funny enough, this car takes no gas."
msgstr "웃기게도, 이 차는 기름이 안 든다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:444
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " find"
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:444
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
" a prepper bunker that is still playing the message. Everyone left in a hurry, leaving behind a stash of supplies.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"아직 메시지를 송출 중인 생존주의자 벙커를 찾는다. 다들 서둘러 떠나서 물자가 남아 있다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:449
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
"THIS IS AN OBVIOUS TRAP SET BY THE GOVERNMENT.\r\n"
"\tTHE SECRET ZOMBIE GOVERNMENT!"
msgstr ""
"이건 정부가 놓은 뻔한 함정이다.\r\n"
"\t비밀 좀비 정부가!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:451
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " wastes no time in "
msgstr "은(는) 지체 없이 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:451
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "PEELING OUT"
msgstr "급출발한다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:451
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
" of there!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
". 그곳에서!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:452
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " is quite relieved to have escaped."
msgstr "은(는) 탈출해서 꽤 안도한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:456
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Mysterious Radio Signal"
msgstr "수수께끼의 라디오 신호"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:457
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
" finds a strange repeating message on the radio. It's a series of short bursts of music, beeps, spoken numbers, and haunting slide whistle noises. There's also a kazoo in there.\r\n"
"\tWhat could it all mean?"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 라디오에서 이상한 반복 메시지를 찾는다. 짧은 음악, 삐 소리, 숫자 읽는 목소리, 소름 끼치는 슬라이드 휘슬 소리. 카주 소리도 있다.\r\n"
"\t대체 무슨 뜻일까?"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:459
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Ignore it"
msgstr "무시한다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:460
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Decipher message"
msgstr "메시지를 해독한다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:461
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Drive to signal"
msgstr "신호를 따라간다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:463
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ": THIS IS A TRAP!"
msgstr ": 이건 함정이야!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:470
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " spends a day trying to fix something in the junk pile... "
msgstr "은(는) 고물 더미에서 뭔가를 고쳐 보려 하루를 보낸다... "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:472
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " accidentally gets a lot of cuts, scrapes, and bruises. "
msgstr "는 실수로 여기저기 베이고 긁히고 멍든다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:472
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " learns about repair, the hard way."
msgstr "는 수리를 혹독하게 배운다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:473
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " takes a broken tennis racket and turned it into a "
msgstr "는 부러진 테니스 라켓을 이렇게 만들었다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:473
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Level 2 Ultra Ergonomic Tennis Racket of the Whale"
msgstr "레벨 2 울트라 인체공학 고래의 테니스 라켓"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:473
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ". This is exactly the same as a regular tennis racket."
msgstr ". 일반 테니스 라켓이랑 똑같다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:474
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " turns a useless Rusted Machete into a useful or at least usable "
msgstr "는 쓸모없는 녹슨 마체테를 쓸 만한, 아니 적어도 쓸 수는 있는 걸로 만든다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:474
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ". It's a clear improvement."
msgstr ". 확실히 나아졌다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:475
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " reinforced a splintered bat with nails and metal to make a "
msgstr "는 쪼개진 방망이를 못과 쇠로 보강해 만든다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:475
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Spiked Bat"
msgstr "가시 방망이"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:475
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "! It's great until it breaks!"
msgstr "! 부러지기 전까진 최고다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:476
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " sharpens a dull "
msgstr "는 무딘 걸 날카롭게 간다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:476
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Branch Trimmer"
msgstr "가지치기 낫"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:476
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "! It's a decent if slightly awkward weapon that won't break on you!"
msgstr "! 좀 어색하지만 부러지지 않는 괜찮은 무기다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:477
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " gets a broken "
msgstr "는 고장 난 걸 다시 작동시킨다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:477
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Leaf Blower"
msgstr "낙엽 송풍기"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:477
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " working again! Send zombies flying like leaves!"
msgstr "! 좀비를 낙엽처럼 날려 버려라!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:478
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " restores a faulty "
msgstr "는 고장 난 걸 복구한다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:478
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Weed Whacker"
msgstr "예초기"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:478
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
"! It's like a slightly wimpy son to the chainsaw! To make up for the lack of"
" power, it's much more gas efficient."
msgstr "! 전기톱의 조금 약골 아들 같은 거다! 힘이 약한 대신 기름을 훨씬 덜 먹는다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:484
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
" works efficiently! By the end of their repair session, there's still plenty"
" of time left in the day."
msgstr "는 효율적으로 작업한다! 수리를 끝내고도 하루가 꽤 남았다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:485
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " decides to fix up an old pistol they found!"
msgstr "은(는) 찾은 낡은 권총을 고치기로 한다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:487
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "REVOLVER GET!"
msgstr "리볼버 획득!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:494
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Who should spend a day repairing junk?"
msgstr "누가 하루 동안 고물을 수리할까?"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:500
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Repair Shop Repair"
msgstr "수리점 수리"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:501
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
" finds a repair shop. There's a tiny bit of gas, plus a lot of broken "
"garbage. There could be something good here, if you know how to fix it."
msgstr "은(는) 수리점을 찾는다. 기름이 조금 있고, 망가진 고물이 잔뜩이다. 고칠 줄만 안다면 좋은 게 있을지도."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:503
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Ignore junk"
msgstr "고물은 무시한다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:504
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ": Repair junk"
msgstr ": 고물을 수리한다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:504
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "You could spend a day repairing things in here."
msgstr "여기서 하루 동안 이것저것 고칠 수 있다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:505
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Pick someone to spend a day repairing junk:"
msgstr "하루 동안 고물을 수리할 사람을 고르세요:"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:517
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "thinks the food is fine."
msgstr "은(는) 음식이 괜찮다고 생각한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:518
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "doesn't mind the horrid food."
msgstr "은(는) 끔찍한 음식도 개의치 않는다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:519
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "has a positive attitude about this slop!"
msgstr "은(는) 이 꿀꿀이죽에 긍정적이다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:520
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "is trying to keep an open mind."
msgstr "은(는) 열린 마음을 가지려 애쓴다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:521
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "pretends that it's junk food instead."
msgstr "은(는) 정크푸드라고 상상한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:522
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "successfully ignores the food."
msgstr "은(는) 음식을 무시하는 데 성공한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:523
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "thinks about curry."
msgstr "은(는) 카레를 생각한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:524
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "focuses on the health benefits."
msgstr "은(는) 건강상의 이점에 집중한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:525
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "tries to block out the smell."
msgstr "은(는) 냄새를 차단하려 한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:526
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "has eaten worse food, possibly."
msgstr "은(는) 아마 더 끔찍한 것도 먹어 봤을 거다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:527
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "mentally blocks out the disgust."
msgstr "은(는) 정신적으로 역겨움을 차단한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:528
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "resists feeling any emotion right now!"
msgstr "은(는) 지금은 어떤 감정도 느끼지 않으려 한다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:550
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " loots the gross health food, picking what "
msgstr "은(는) 역겨운 건강식을 챙긴다. 고르는 건 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:550
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
" can live with.\r\n"
"  This turns out to be not that much of the food in total."
msgstr ""
"이(가) 견딜 수 있는 것만.\r\n"
"  결국 전체 중 얼마 안 된다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:554
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " feels healthier just looking at the gross food!"
msgstr "은(는) 역겨운 음식을 보기만 해도 건강해지는 기분이다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:559
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " hands most of the food to "
msgstr "은(는) 음식 대부분을 넘겨준다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:559
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " in preparation for their "
msgstr "에게. 준비를 위해: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:559
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "ULTRA GIGA-MARATHON"
msgstr "울트라 기가 마라톤"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:559
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ", leaving a solitary granola bar."
msgstr ". 남은 건 그래놀라 바 하나뿐."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:560
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
" runs nearly one hundred laps around the store. When asked whether this is "
"actually equivalent to marathon, they reply with "
msgstr "은(는) 가게를 거의 백 바퀴 돈다. 그게 정말 마라톤이랑 같냐고 묻자, 대답은 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:560
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "''probably''"
msgstr "''아마도''"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:562
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
" has a brainwave: why not run a marathon with all this runner's food? They "
"TOTALLY could! With nobody else around to stop them, they start CARB-"
"LOADING."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 기발한 생각을 한다: 이 러너용 음식으로 마라톤을 하면 되잖아? 완전 할 수 있어! 말릴 사람도 없으니 탄수화물 로딩을 "
"시작한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:563
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Without having a proper route, "
msgstr "제대로 된 코스가 없어서, "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:563
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
" decides to just run 100 laps around the store. That's the same thing, "
"right?"
msgstr "는 그냥 가게를 100바퀴 돌기로 한다. 똑같은 거 아냐?"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:567
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "'s legs are like jelly! "
msgstr "의 다리가 젤리처럼 풀렸다! "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:567
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " is exhausted."
msgstr "는 녹초가 됐다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:572
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Health Food Havoc"
msgstr "건강식품 대소동"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:573
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
" finds a health food store. It seems like no one bothered to loot it because the food was disgusting.\r\n"
"\tMost of the food seems to be rotting anyway. Or maybe it's not, it could be that the food is supposed to look and smell like this."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 건강식품점을 찾는다. 음식이 역겨워서 아무도 털지 않은 것 같다.\r\n"
"\t음식 대부분이 썩어 가는 것 같다. 아니면 원래 그렇게 생기고 냄새나는 건지도."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:575
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Ignore for morale reasons"
msgstr "사기를 위해 무시한다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:576
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Loot the gross food"
msgstr "역겨운 음식을 챙긴다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:578
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ": CARB-LOADING MARATHON"
msgstr ": 탄수화물 로딩 마라톤"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:588
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
"The machine starts its patented automated total-body bodybuilding "
"regiment..."
msgstr "기계가 특허받은 전신 자동 보디빌딩 프로그램을 시작한다..."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:589
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "'s body makes audible snapping and crunching sounds! How horrifying!"
msgstr "의 몸에서 뚝뚝, 우두둑 소리가 난다! 끔찍하다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:592
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "The machine clamps "
msgstr "기계가 고정한다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:592
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " in place for its innovative gymnastics simulator..."
msgstr "을(를). 혁신적인 체조 시뮬레이터를 위해..."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:593
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
"A high-tension cable snaps free and whips around! There's no time to react "
"to it!"
msgstr "고장력 케이블이 튕겨 나와 휘두른다! 피할 틈도 없다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:599
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " finishes "
msgstr "은(는) 마친다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:599
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " workouts, no matter the cost!"
msgstr " 운동을, 무슨 대가를 치르더라도!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:602
#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:610
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "A little speaker on the machine says "
msgstr "기계의 작은 스피커가 말한다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:602
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "NO PAIN NO GAIN!"
msgstr "고통 없이는 성장도 없다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:607
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " uses the innovative Swolo-O-Flex personal exercise system..."
msgstr "은(는) 혁신적인 스월-오-플렉스 개인 운동 시스템을 사용한다..."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:610
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "NO REFUNDS!"
msgstr "환불 불가!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:612
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Avoid further injury"
msgstr "더 다치기 전에 그만둔다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:613
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Finish workout!"
msgstr "운동을 끝까지 한다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:617
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Who should get maimed or killed by the Swole-O-Flex?"
msgstr "누가 스월-오-플렉스에 다치거나 죽을까?"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:622
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Swole-O-Flex"
msgstr "스월-오-플렉스"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:624
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " stumbles upon a "
msgstr "은(는) 우연히 발견한다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:624
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Swole-O-Flex Home Strength and Fitness Machine [tm]"
msgstr "스월-오-플렉스 홈 근력 & 체력 머신 [tm]"
